                <p rendition="#center">In the Court of Quarter Sessions of the Peace in and for the
                    county of Luzerne, Pennsylvania. Sessions 1898.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Luzerne County</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ss:</hi></p>
